      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 100
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Domestic cats may be called \"house cats\" when kept as indoor ",
      "n_tokens_est": 13,
      "pos_start_est": 103
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "pets",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 116
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": ".",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 117
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " They are one of the most popular ",
      "n_tokens_est": 7,
      "pos_start_est": 118
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "pets",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 125
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " in the world. ",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 126
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "Humans",
      "n_tokens_est": 1,
      "pos_start_est": 130
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " keep them for hunting mice and rats, and as friends. There are also farm cats, which keep ",
      "n_tokens_est": 20,
      "pos_start_est": 131
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "mice and rats",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 151
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " away; and ",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 154
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "feral cats",
      "n_tokens_est": 2,
      "pos_start_est": 157
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": ", which are domestic cats that live away from humans.",
      "n_tokens_est": 11,
      "pos_start_est": 159
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " In 2021, there were about 220 million pet cats and 480 million feral cats in the world.",
      "n_tokens_est": 19,
      "pos_start_est": 170
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 189
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 193
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "There are about 92 breeds of cat.",
      "n_tokens_est": 8,
      "pos_start_est": 196
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": " Domestic cats are found in shorthair, longhair, and hairless breeds. Cats which are not specific breeds can be referred to as 'domestic shorthair' (DSH) or 'domestic longhair' (DLH).",
      "n_tokens_est": 40,
      "pos_start_est": 204
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "</p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 4,
      "pos_start_est": 244
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "markup",
      "text": "<p>",
      "n_tokens_est": 3,
      "pos_start_est": 248
    },
    {
      "node_id": 2,
      "seq_id": 1,
      "kind": "content",
      "text": "The word 'cat' is also used for other ",
